        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "http:ActionSendData",
            "version": 3,
            "parameters": {
                "handleErrors": true,
                "useNewZLibDeCompress": true
            },
            "mapper": {
                "ca": "",
                "qs": [],
                "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
                "data": "{\r\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\r\n  \"max_tokens\": 4000,\r\n  \"temperature\": 0.3,\r\n  \"messages\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"role\": \"system\",\r\n      \"content\": \"You are a personal chef assistant for Nutrition Intuition, LLC. Your job is to create Chef Briefings and Personalized Menus based STRICTLY on client intake form data.\\n\\nCRITICAL RULES:\\n1. ONLY use information explicitly stated in the intake form - NEVER invent, assume, or hallucinate any dietary restrictions, preferences, or details not provided\\n2. If a field says 'NA', 'None', or is empty, state that no restrictions/preferences were specified for that category - DO NOT make up restrictions\\n3. The client's FAVORITE MEALS and FAVORITE RESTAURANTS are extremely important - incorporate dishes inspired by these\\n4. Use ONLY the proteins, vegetables, grains, and ingredients the client selected - never add items they didn't choose\\n5. Pay attention to meal type (Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner) and meals per week\\n6. Include household members by name if provided\\n7. Output ONLY valid HTML using <h2>, <p>, <ol>, <li>, <strong>, <br> tags. No markdown.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"role\": \"user\",\r\n      \"content\": \"Create an HTML email with TWO sections based STRICTLY on this client's intake form. DO NOT invent any information not in the form.\\n\\nSECTION 1 - CHEF'S BRIEFING:\\n<h2 style='color: #495057; border-bottom: 2px solid #e74c3c; padding-bottom: 10px;'>Chef's Briefing</h2>\\nWrite 3-4 paragraphs covering ONLY what the form says about:\\n- Household members (list names if provided)\\n- Dietary protocol and allergies (if 'NA' or empty, state 'No dietary restrictions specified')\\n- Desired outcomes (quote their exact answer)\\n- Meal types needed and frequency per week\\n- Spice tolerance level\\n- Their stated favorite meals and restaurants (IMPORTANT - these guide the menu!)\\n\\nSECTION 2 - PERSONALIZED 15-ITEM MENU:\\n<h2 style='color: #495057; border-bottom: 2px solid #28a745; padding-bottom: 10px;'>Personalized 15-Item Menu</h2>\\nCreate 15 dinner items that:\\n- Include variations of their FAVORITE MEALS (e.g., if they said 'burger bowls', include burger bowl variations)\\n- Use ONLY proteins they selected (check Meat, Poultry, Seafood, Vegetarian sections)\\n- Use ONLY vegetables they selected (check all color categories)\\n- Use ONLY grains, beans, dairy they selected\\n- Respect their spice level preference\\n- Match the meal type they requested (Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner)\\n\\nFormat each item as: <li><strong>Dish Name</strong> - Brief description mentioning key ingredients from their selections</li>\\n\\nClient Name: {{replace(replace(2.fullName; newline; \" \"); \"\\\"\"; \"'\")}}\\n\\n=== INTAKE FORM DATA (USE ONLY THIS) ===\\n{{replace(replace(replace(9.notes[1].body; \"\\\\\"; \"\\\\\\\\\"); \"\\\"\"; \"\\\\\\\"\"); newline; \"\\\\n\")}}\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}",
                "gzip": true,
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [
                    {
                        "name": "Authorization",
                        "value": "Bearer YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY_HERE"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "timeout": "",
                "useMtls": false,
                "authPass": "",
                "authUser": "",
                "bodyType": "raw",
                "contentType": "application/json",
                "serializeUrl": false,
                "shareCookies": false,
                "parseResponse": true,
                "followRedirect": true,
                "useQuerystring": false,
                "followAllRedirects": false,
                "rejectUnauthorized": true
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 910,
                    "y": 7
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "qs": {
                            "mode": "chose"
                        },
                        "method": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "POST"
                        },
                        "headers": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "items": [
                                null,
                                null
                            ]
                        },
                        "bodyType": {
                            "label": "Raw"
                        },
                        "contentType": {
                            "label": "JSON (application/json)"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "handleErrors",
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "label": "Evaluate all states as errors (except for 2xx and 3xx )",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "useNewZLibDeCompress",
                        "type": "hidden"
                    }
                ],
                "expect": [
                    {
                        "name": "url",
                        "type": "url",
                        "label": "URL",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "serializeUrl",
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "label": "Serialize URL",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "method",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Method",
                        "required": true,
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "get",
                                "head",
                                "post",
                                "put",
                                "patch",
                                "delete",
                                "options"
                            ]
                        }
